content commerce]

478
00:27:29,689 --> 00:27:33,491
[The only seller of the team
who does livestream commerce]

479
00:27:33,491 --> 00:27:40,052
I have made sales of 40 to 50 million yen
in one live broadcast.

480
00:27:40,052 --> 00:27:44,286
There were months I exceeded 100 million yen
in sales if you combine many brands.

481
00:27:44,286 --> 00:27:49,184
[Team Japan's ace with a massive amount
of sales and numerous livestreaming experience]

482
00:27:49,184 --> 00:27:53,931
You all know I'm in the making of a corset?

483
00:27:55,329 --> 00:28:00,131
I'm working as a producer for a corset brand.

484
00:28:00,131 --> 00:28:02,352
[A corset she made herself in collaboration
with a lingerie brand]

485
00:28:02,352 --> 00:28:06,933
I was born a boy, but in the process
of my transition to become a woman,

486
00:28:06,933 --> 00:28:10,121
[Past the time that felt
like wearing ill-fitting clothes]

487
00:28:11,726 --> 00:28:14,692
[Her true self finally faces the world]

488
00:28:15,242 --> 00:28:19,615
I wanted to change my body shape
that looked like that of a man.

489
00:28:19,615 --> 00:28:23,815
I worked so hard, even wearing it in my sleep.

490
00:28:23,815 --> 00:28:26,170
Thanks to the corset,

491
00:28:26,170 --> 00:28:28,689
I could fit into a dress that I wasn't able to,

492
00:28:28,689 --> 00:28:30,638
or into a tight dress
that accentuates your curves.

493
00:28:30,638 --> 00:28:33,015
It was a big comfort to me.

494
00:28:33,493 --> 00:28:37,462
[Where is this place welcoming Sana?]
Sana, it's been a while.

495
00:28:37,462 --> 00:28:41,116
The nostalgic pink dress
from the last time is finished.

496
00:28:41,116 --> 00:28:43,863
I'm also making a wedding dress.

497
00:28:43,863 --> 00:28:48,899
[Sana is also the CEO of a wedding brand]

498
00:28:48,899 --> 00:28:50,083
How is the color?

499
00:28:50,083 --> 00:28:52,271
The color is perfect.

500
00:28:52,271 --> 00:28:56,014
The last time, we considered a pale pink.

501
00:28:56,014 --> 00:29:00,423
Each of them has a very different impression,
both would look very pretty.

502
00:29:00,423 --> 00:29:02,707
In the wedding dress industry of Japan,

503
00:29:02,707 --> 00:29:05,847
even though I found something very pretty,
they'd say "this is not going to fit you."

504
00:29:05,847 --> 00:29:09,279
I had such occasions a couple of times
that hurt my feelings badly.

505
00:29:09,279 --> 00:29:13,708
Regardless of your body, nationality,
or gender,

506
00:29:13,708 --> 00:29:16,597
I would never let you have a sad experience
when you come to choose a wedding dress.

507
00:29:16,597 --> 00:29:21,406
My brand will provide dresses to fit anyone
in any shape.

508
00:29:21,406 --> 00:29:24,077
The key point of all the items
I'm involved in producing is

509
00:29:24,077 --> 00:29:28,759
that they are being made for myself.

510
00:29:29,915 --> 00:29:35,778
When you say the leading influencer of Japan,
you think of me.

511
00:29:35,778 --> 00:29:37,641
I've been in this field for a long time.

512
00:29:37,641 --> 00:29:43,808
If I don't lead my team properly,
I can't make a good example as a leader.

513
00:29:43,808 --> 00:29:47,758
So, I'll do my best to lead my team well.

514
00:29:53,411 --> 00:29:54,914
[Team Thailand's owner, BamBam]

515
00:29:54,914 --> 00:29:58,302
As a national representative of Thailand,

516
00:29:58,302 --> 00:30:00,113
Is it okay to say this?

517
00:30:00,113 --> 00:30:01,537
Of course it is.

518
00:30:01,537 --> 00:30:04,001
Is it? I'm the owner.

519
00:30:04,001 --> 00:30:06,284
Isn't he too overpowering?

520
00:30:06,284 --> 00:30:07,893
That's intimidating.

521
00:30:07,893 --> 00:30:11,110
If BamBam featured in my show,
all products will be sold out.

522
00:30:11,110 --> 00:30:13,873
[BamBam singlehandedly changed the game,
all countries are watching out for Thailand]

523
00:30:14,619 --> 00:30:19,308
I think my role here is being their pride.

524
00:30:19,308 --> 00:30:23,484
In Thailand,
even grannies and gramps know me.

525
00:30:23,484 --> 00:30:26,681
[The presence that shakes up Thailand]
Even in a forest, people would recognize me.

526
00:30:26,681 --> 00:30:29,271
At least for now, for them,

527
00:30:29,271 --> 00:30:32,039
the fact that they can say
"I belong to BamBam's team"

528
00:30:32,039 --> 00:30:36,926
could be something that fires up their passion.

529
00:30:36,926 --> 00:30:41,608
So I am the team's passion, or its pride.

530
00:30:41,608 --> 00:30:44,544
[Their value is proven by his existence alone]
I'm the national representative of Thailand.

531
00:30:44,544 --> 00:30:47,578
[BamBam, the owner of Team Thailand]

532
00:30:49,096 --> 00:30:52,021
- We're here.
- We arrived at BamBam's company.

533
00:30:52,537 --> 00:30:57,147
[Team Thailand gathered at BamBam's company]

534
00:31:00,140 --> 00:31:02,225
Welcome.

535
00:31:02,225 --> 00:31:03,593
- Hello.
- Hello.

536
00:31:03,593 --> 00:31:07,621
[A joyful second meeting]
- Hello. - Hello.

537
00:31:07,621 --> 00:31:09,783
[Why is Team Thailand gathered here?]

538
00:31:09,783 --> 00:31:13,458
To be honest,
we were feeling a little bit burdened.

539
00:31:13,458 --> 00:31:18,114
Because we were in 7th place
in the pre-match mission.

540
00:31:18,114 --> 00:31:19,490
It's alright.

541
00:31:19,490 --> 00:31:23,516
We came to get some advice from you, BamBam.

542
00:31:23,516 --> 00:31:26,330
It was only a pre-match mission.

543
00:31:26,330 --> 00:31:29,095
Some people have everything going well
and then trip over suddenly.

544
00:31:29,095 --> 00:31:33,062
But those who build strong bases like us
will have a stronger root.

545
00:31:33,062 --> 00:31:34,573
[You're right]

546
00:31:34,573 --> 00:31:37,517
[Team Thailand with strong resolution]
We go forward one step at a time, taking time.

547
00:31:37,517 --> 00:31:40,997
Our goal is the same, right?
Getting the first place?

548
00:31:40,997 --> 00:31:42,259
Right.

549
00:31:42,259 --> 00:31:45,291
I think, for us to win,

550
00:31:45,291 --> 00:31:49,577
we need to have more customized plans
based on who we are competing against.

551
00:31:49,577 --> 00:31:52,393
[In a nutshell, one-on-one targeting]
Especially against those who we need to win.

552
00:31:52,393 --> 00:31:54,893
[Captain Fluke prepared personal analysis]

553
00:31:54,893 --> 00:31:57,578
[Viet Anh / Ran Gaoming / Kkang Stylist]
I think these three

554
00:31:57,578 --> 00:32:01,179
from Team Vietnam, China, and Korea
are very much like me.

555
00:32:01,179 --> 00:32:05,888
They're interested in their appearances,
and they own a food business.

556
00:32:06,833 --> 00:32:11,263
[The three of them work in several fields
across food, beauty and fashion]

557
00:32:11,263 --> 00:32:12,886
[Health supplements business]
I'm also in both food and beauty businesses.

558
00:32:12,886 --> 00:32:14,646
[An aesthetic clinic]
I'm also in both food and beauty businesses.

559
00:32:14,646 --> 00:32:18,077
I think these three are my rivals.

560
00:32:18,077 --> 00:32:22,355
[Understood]
I need to win against these three.

561
00:32:22,355 --> 00:32:25,292
[Next up are Yokthong's rivals]
For Yok.

562
00:32:25,292 --> 00:32:28,124
[Khanh Huyen / Xiaoshu Ouni / Sangeununnie]
Content creators, beauty and K-beauty experts.

563
00:32:28,124 --> 00:32:30,161
I can handle these three areas.

564
00:32:30,161 --> 00:32:33,214
I looked into your analytics,
and you are in the top three on Thai TikTok.

565
00:32:33,214 --> 00:32:34,566
Really?

566
00:32:34,566 --> 00:32:36,036
In sales.

567
00:32:38,190 --> 00:32:41,616
For sales, we can rely on you, Yok.

568
00:32:41,616 --> 00:32:43,659
Based on the rules we have for this round,

569
00:32:43,659 --> 00:32:46,022
I think Yok fits the best for the mission.

570
00:32:46,022 --> 00:32:49,529
[Confident]
I think you could be the most efficient player.

571
00:32:57,824 --> 00:33:00,540
Hi, I'm Yok Jittraphan.

572
00:33:00,540 --> 00:33:04,262
I'm an influencer and a content creator.

573
00:33:04,262 --> 00:33:06,388
I'm also a seller on TikTok Shop.

574
00:33:06,388 --> 00:33:11,171
[Yok is a top e-commerce seller in Thailand]
[Top 3 sell-out seller on TikTok Shop]

575
00:33:11,171 --> 00:33:16,218
Hello, I'm here at TikTok Awards 2026 today.

576
00:33:18,311 --> 00:33:22,352
[Please root for me]
I'm nominated for Super Top Creator.

577
00:33:22,352 --> 00:33:26,179
The nominees for the most sales in 2026
on TikTok Shop.

578
00:33:27,988 --> 00:33:29,588
Yok Jittraphan.

579
00:33:34,217 --> 00:33:38,184
This is one of the biggest awards of this year.

580
00:33:38,184 --> 00:33:44,069
[Awarded Super Top Creator]

581
00:33:44,069 --> 00:33:46,315
I didn't earn the place of top three so easily.

582
00:33:46,315 --> 00:33:48,592
I'll make it happen in X THE LEAGUE, too.

583
00:33:48,592 --> 00:33:53,688
I'll make it to the top of X THE LEAGUE
in Korea.

584
00:33:56,440 --> 00:33:59,103
[Who is that person cheerfully greeting Yok?]

585
00:33:59,103 --> 00:34:01,480
[Super rich seller from Thailand, Kathy Phol]

586
00:34:02,620 --> 00:34:07,127
[Kathy's dad is invited to the TikTok Awards]

587
00:34:07,127 --> 00:34:10,897
Hi, I'm Kathy Phol from Thailand.

588
00:34:10,897 --> 00:34:15,536
You can say
that everyone in my family is an influencer.

589
00:34:16,055 --> 00:34:18,886
[The whole influencer family is here]

590
00:34:18,886 --> 00:34:22,100
[Kathy's father is the CEO of a dental brand
and an influencer, Dr. Sunil]

591
00:34:22,100 --> 00:34:25,400
[The entire family is a hot influencer]

592
00:34:26,756 --> 00:34:29,932
[Even the gate looks extraordinary here]

593
00:34:31,474 --> 00:34:34,334
[A massive mansion on another level]

594
00:34:34,334 --> 00:34:36,849
Hello, Hi.

595
00:34:36,849 --> 00:34:40,341
Welcome to Kathy's home.

596
00:34:40,341 --> 00:34:42,690
Today, I'll give you a tour of my place.

597
00:34:42,690 --> 00:34:44,231
Let's go, follow me.

598
00:34:44,231 --> 00:34:50,506
When I'm livestreaming,
I shoot in every corner of my home.

599
00:34:50,506 --> 00:34:54,087
[Home sweet home,
where every content and livestream starts]

600
00:34:58,412 --> 00:35:01,819
It's the dining room, everyone.

601
00:35:01,819 --> 00:35:03,984
We always have every seat ready.

602
00:35:03,984 --> 00:35:09,587
You never know when friends
or guests might drop by.

603
00:35:09,587 --> 00:35:13,017
[A dining room fit for a five-star hotel]

604
00:35:14,750 --> 00:35:16,027
Hello.

605
00:35:16,027 --> 00:35:20,331
Welcome to Kathy's dressing room.
Come take a look.

606
00:35:24,583 --> 00:35:28,839
This is where I display my bag collection.

607
00:35:29,750 --> 00:35:34,312
All my dresses and clothes are in here,
along with all my bags and accessories.

608
00:35:34,312 --> 00:35:37,717
Everything's kept in this dressing room.

609
00:35:37,717 --> 00:35:40,217
[Glamour at its finest]

610
00:35:40,217 --> 00:35:44,491
Next up is this room.

611
00:35:44,491 --> 00:35:50,228
I throw a lot of parties here.

612
00:35:50,228 --> 00:35:53,665
It's called the disco room.

613
00:35:53,665 --> 00:35:59,639
Once I started livestreaming,

614
00:35:59,639 --> 00:36:04,876
this became my main livestreaming room.

615
00:36:04,876 --> 00:36:12,518
So my party room became my livestream studio.

616
00:36:12,518 --> 00:36:17,622
I grew up with everything I needed,

617
00:36:17,622 --> 00:36:20,225
but I still wanted to achieve
something of my own.

618
00:36:20,225 --> 00:36:24,429
So I started livestream commerce
on social media.

619
00:36:24,429 --> 00:36:29,017
[All staff prep for Kathy's livestream]

620
00:36:34,384 --> 00:36:39,277
I run the whole operation myself.
It's split into three teams.

621
00:36:39,277 --> 00:36:41,451
First is the production team.

622
00:36:41,451 --> 00:36:45,350
They handle cameras, lighting, sound,
and other technical work.

623
00:36:45,350 --> 00:36:51,258
Second is the product team.
They mainly handle product listings.

624
00:36:51,258 --> 00:36:55,460
Third is the guest relations team.

625
00:36:55,460 --> 00:36:58,329
They take care of customers
and visiting brand representatives.

626
00:36:58,329 --> 00:37:01,717
[Super rich seller from Thailand]
Once they finish setting everything up,

627
00:37:01,717 --> 00:37:06,704
I check the overall flow and go live.

628
00:37:08,884 --> 00:37:11,476
[The first livestream finally begins]
Hello!

629
00:37:11,476 --> 00:37:13,511
Hi!

630
00:37:13,511 --> 00:37:16,550
Our first X THE LEAGUE product is here.

631
00:37:16,550 --> 00:37:20,585
Can I get a round of applause?

632
00:37:20,585 --> 00:37:26,683
This is the first product I'm presenting in
this competition as Thailand's representative.

633
00:37:26,683 --> 00:37:30,717
I do livestream commerce so I can stay
connected with my fans for years to come.

634
00:37:30,717 --> 00:37:32,984
I love spending time talking with everyone.

635
00:37:32,984 --> 00:37:37,635
My fans are like family to me.

636
00:37:38,202 --> 00:37:41,239
Honestly, I'd love to give my livestream a ten.

637
00:37:41,239 --> 00:37:45,243
But a ten isn't possible. Nothing's perfect.

638
00:37:45,243 --> 00:37:49,580
Nothing's 100 percent perfect,
so I'd give it a seven.

639
00:37:49,580 --> 00:37:53,115
[Malaysia]

640
00:37:55,217 --> 00:37:58,322
I have so much to do today.

641
00:38:03,251 --> 00:38:05,697
[The K-beauty sales queen of Malaysia]
Hello, everyone. I'm Sonia.

642
00:38:05,697 --> 00:38:11,650
I'm a livestream host in Malaysia,
and I mainly use two platforms.

643
00:38:11,650 --> 00:38:14,451
One is Instagram,
where I do a lot of group buys

644
00:38:14,451 --> 00:38:18,676
and post purchase links for my followers
to buy various products.

645
00:38:18,676 --> 00:38:21,279
The other is TikTok Live.

646
00:38:21,279 --> 00:38:26,017
I know which bundles are most appealing
to the market.

647
00:38:26,017 --> 00:38:31,989
That's why I always put bundles first
in both my livestreams and group buys.

648
00:38:31,989 --> 00:38:34,492
Bundles are essential.

649
00:38:34,492 --> 00:38:39,263
They're the first thing we need to plan
for a group buy or livestream.

650
00:38:39,263 --> 00:38:40,484
[Online meeting to negotiate sales terms]

651
00:38:40,484 --> 00:38:41,666
[Brand representative]
Hi.

652
00:38:41,666 --> 00:38:43,634
Hello.

653
00:38:44,102 --> 00:38:47,407
But honestly, the price...

654
00:38:47,407 --> 00:38:50,108
seems higher than we expected.

655
00:38:50,108 --> 00:38:53,544
I think the problem is...

656
00:38:53,544 --> 00:38:57,315
that it's only available as a single item.

657
00:38:57,315 --> 00:38:59,650
During our last livestream,

658
00:38:59,650 --> 00:39:05,857
I shared customer reviews with my followers,
and they gave me feedback.

659
00:39:05,857 --> 00:39:09,527
I think it would be better
if we could offer mix-and-match options.

660
00:39:09,527 --> 00:39:12,096
For example, people might love

661
00:39:12,096 --> 00:39:15,933
[She even gives an example]
the red one and the blue one as a set.

662
00:39:15,933 --> 00:39:18,035
[She stresses the value of bundles]
We should also try to offer

663
00:39:18,035 --> 00:39:20,004
as many combinations as possible.

664
00:39:20,004 --> 00:39:24,475
Usually,
when I'm asked to attend a brand meeting,

665
00:39:24,475 --> 00:39:28,913
it's because we need to discuss the bundles
and how I want to arrange them.

666
00:39:28,913 --> 00:39:31,916
If 100 percent is the maximum,

667
00:39:31,916 --> 00:39:34,117
I'd say I know them not 100 percent,

668
00:39:34,117 --> 00:39:36,754
[The K-beauty sales queen of Malaysia]
I'd say I know them 102 percent

669
00:39:36,754 --> 00:39:38,723
because the results have proven it.

670
00:39:38,723 --> 00:39:40,761
[Four-piece mask and cleanser kit]
I genuinely understand

671
00:39:40,761 --> 00:39:43,694
[Popular set: body wash and body butter]
what people need.

672
00:39:43,694 --> 00:39:47,031
[Sonia zeroes in on shoppers' needs]

673
00:39:47,031 --> 00:39:50,968
Let's say I'm only selling a shirt,

674
00:39:50,968 --> 00:39:54,405
for example, and it costs 60 Malaysian ringgit.

675
00:39:54,405 --> 00:39:58,242
My followers will only spend 60 ringgit.

676
00:39:58,242 --> 00:40:02,317
[Shirt: 60 ringgit]
But if you bundle the shirt with pants,

677
00:40:02,317 --> 00:40:04,515
then it could sell for 120 ringgit.

678
00:40:04,515 --> 00:40:06,984
That would increase the average order value,

679
00:40:06,984 --> 00:40:12,690
[Bundles raise overall sales]
making it much easier for our sales to grow.

680
00:40:12,690 --> 00:40:13,884
That's what we're trying to do.

681
00:40:13,884 --> 00:40:20,950
That's because I mainly push
large three-item bundles.

682
00:40:20,950 --> 00:40:25,303
However, I think the price is a little high.

683
00:40:25,303 --> 00:40:30,284
[What will the brand say?]

684
00:40:30,284 --> 00:40:33,151
I think we can do 165 ringgit.

685
00:40:33,151 --> 00:40:34,212
Okay.

686
00:40:34,212 --> 00:40:35,717
[Bundle discount secured]

687
00:40:35,717 --> 00:40:38,983
I don't think this is bad for the brand.

688
00:40:38,983 --> 00:40:43,051
The more I sell,
the more people will discover the brand.

689
00:40:43,051 --> 00:40:48,317
The brand gets long-term exposure
and benefits greatly.

690
00:40:48,317 --> 00:40:51,162
[Brand ties keep sales steady]
They might not earn as much per sale,

691
00:40:51,162 --> 00:40:53,698
but they'll still make a profit.

692
00:40:53,698 --> 00:40:55,659
[Seoul, South Korea]

693
00:40:58,418 --> 00:41:01,643
[Team USA visits headquarters to negotiate]

694
00:41:02,740 --> 00:41:06,384
[What did Team USA pick in Round 1?]
Hi, how are you?

695
00:41:06,384 --> 00:41:11,315
We mostly chose beauty products
and a few wellness products

696
00:41:11,315 --> 00:41:16,017
because I think they suit our team best
in terms of what we can sell.

697
00:41:16,017 --> 00:41:19,557
One of the wellness products is
the olive oil and lemon shot.

698
00:41:19,557 --> 00:41:23,427
Francesca and I drink olive oil
and lemon juice every day.

699
00:41:23,427 --> 00:41:25,596
It's something we really enjoy.

700
00:41:25,596 --> 00:41:28,370
[Team USA showed interest in K-supplements]

701
00:41:29,151 --> 00:41:31,002
Are you guys on TikTok?

702
00:41:31,002 --> 00:41:34,117
We actually just opened our TikTok Shop.

703
00:41:34,117 --> 00:41:36,173
How long ago did you join?

704
00:41:36,173 --> 00:41:38,209
Three months ago.

705
00:41:38,209 --> 00:41:40,418
Do you guys want to promote it
on TikTok Shop, then?

706
00:41:40,418 --> 00:41:41,982
[Please help us]
Oh, yes, of course.

707
00:41:41,982 --> 00:41:44,015
Ayanna has a huge TikTok Shop audience.

708
00:41:44,015 --> 00:41:47,017
[That's my specialty]

709
00:41:47,017 --> 00:41:54,358
I think we should run a special promotion
for TikTok Shop buyers.

710
00:41:54,358 --> 00:41:57,495
We could offer a bundle discount
or some other perk.

711
00:41:57,495 --> 00:42:00,184
Maybe a first-purchase offer.

712
00:42:00,184 --> 00:42:02,850
Since we'd be introducing
this product to the US,

713
00:42:02,850 --> 00:42:07,471
a bold introductory offer or special perk

714
00:42:07,471 --> 00:42:09,674
would make it much easier to sell there.

715
