958
00:55:54,284 --> 00:55:56,566
was that the results
fell short of expectations.

959
00:55:56,566 --> 00:56:03,777
[Indonesia's K-beauty owner]
It's time for Team Indonesia to come together

960
00:56:03,777 --> 00:56:07,344
and find a solution.

961
00:56:07,344 --> 00:56:09,550
[Weak sales force an emergency meeting]

962
00:56:09,550 --> 00:56:12,449
We have to give it our all today.

963
00:56:12,449 --> 00:56:16,219
We've already tried livestreaming.

964
00:56:16,219 --> 00:56:17,617
We tried collagen and a few other products.

965
00:56:17,617 --> 00:56:19,051
We need to analyze what was missing

966
00:56:19,051 --> 00:56:21,151
and push the products that sold well earlier.

967
00:56:21,151 --> 00:56:23,817
I've been saying that since yesterday.

968
00:56:23,817 --> 00:56:26,796
The round started on the 23rd,
so I said we should just go live.

969
00:56:27,464 --> 00:56:33,009
[Team Indonesia starts selling on Day 5]

970
00:56:33,703 --> 00:56:38,876
[Mami streamed steadily from Day 1]

971
00:56:39,376 --> 00:56:41,845
[Mami disliked the team's livestream schedule]

972
00:56:41,845 --> 00:56:45,017
It was the Lebaran holiday.

973
00:56:45,017 --> 00:56:47,717
We missed our window.
Don't you think that hurt us?

974
00:56:47,717 --> 00:56:49,319
My total sales are already high enough.

975
00:56:49,319 --> 00:56:52,155
That isn't enough.
We could be overtaken in no time.

976
00:56:52,155 --> 00:56:54,384
We can catch up again.

977
00:56:54,384 --> 00:56:59,763
[Weak sales spark conflict within the team]

978
00:56:59,763 --> 00:57:05,235
Round 1 actually began
for all eight teams on the 23rd.

979
00:57:05,235 --> 00:57:06,418
But in Indonesia,

980
00:57:06,418 --> 00:57:09,906
we didn't launch until today, the 27th.

981
00:57:09,906 --> 00:57:12,850
During the long holiday

982
00:57:12,850 --> 00:57:15,882
[Indonesia's biggest holiday: Lebaran]
called Lebaran,

983
00:57:15,882 --> 00:57:19,344
many people returned home
to be with their families,

984
00:57:19,344 --> 00:57:23,523
and they had already spent
their salaries and other money.

985
00:57:23,523 --> 00:57:26,217
So because of these timing issues,

986
00:57:26,217 --> 00:57:28,195
[Indonesia's K-beauty owner]
it was harder for us

987
00:57:28,195 --> 00:57:30,326
to generate strong overall sales.

988
00:57:30,326 --> 00:57:32,884
[Unexpected local factors hurt their start]

989
00:57:32,884 --> 00:57:35,899
We can't afford to be this divided.

990
00:57:35,899 --> 00:57:38,869
Don't expect any more days off.
You're always trying to take breaks.

991
00:57:38,869 --> 00:57:41,451
We only took one day off yesterday...

992
00:57:41,451 --> 00:57:44,074
Then I'll bother you at Christmas.

993
00:57:44,074 --> 00:57:49,040
[Team Indonesia's conflict deepens]

994
00:57:50,247 --> 00:57:55,579
[What lies ahead for Team Indonesia?]

995
00:57:56,386 --> 00:57:59,844
[Korea]

996
00:58:01,284 --> 00:58:03,284
[Round 1, D+10: Seoul, South Korea]
How have you been?

997
00:58:03,284 --> 00:58:05,195
[Team Korea gathers in one place]
You've lost so much weight, haven't you?

998
00:58:05,195 --> 00:58:07,351
Your face looks even smaller.

999
00:58:07,351 --> 00:58:08,850
Seriously.

1000
00:58:08,850 --> 00:58:10,036
It's from stress.

1001
00:58:10,036 --> 00:58:13,336
- Have you been under a lot of stress?
- Because of X THE LEAGUE.

1002
00:58:13,336 --> 00:58:16,239
It's fun,
but I think it's a little stressful too.

1003
00:58:16,239 --> 00:58:19,209
Sangeun's launching
her Beauty Battle this time.

1004
00:58:19,209 --> 00:58:20,911
How did you make your Reels so good?

1005
00:58:20,911 --> 00:58:22,084
You really went all out.

1006
00:58:22,084 --> 00:58:23,647
She put a lot into them.

1007
00:58:23,647 --> 00:58:25,284
[Promo content draws lots of attention]

1008
00:58:25,284 --> 00:58:27,284
- It was fun.
- I was growling.

1009
00:58:27,284 --> 00:58:31,151
- It was so much fun.
- You're handling the most products in Round 1.

1010
00:58:31,151 --> 00:58:32,589
Why did you choose so many?

1011
00:58:32,589 --> 00:58:35,792
[Sangeununnie handles the most products]
When I saw all 150 products listed,

1012
00:58:35,792 --> 00:58:41,017
there were so many good ones
that I wanted to show them all,

1013
00:58:41,017 --> 00:58:43,767
but I didn't know
it'd take this much out of me.

1014
00:58:43,767 --> 00:58:45,068
[Ten days without a break]

1015
00:58:45,068 --> 00:58:47,084
Kkakk Unni, your Cuckoo deal earlier...

1016
00:58:47,084 --> 00:58:48,705
I was amazed.

1017
00:58:48,705 --> 00:58:50,640
I went straight to their headquarters.

1018
00:58:50,640 --> 00:58:54,451
[She visits HQ to secure a special price]
I went in and negotiated hard.

1019
00:58:54,451 --> 00:59:00,217
They gave us an incredible price
and told us to make sure Team Korea wins.

1020
00:59:00,217 --> 00:59:01,952
Once a deal gets this kind of response,

1021
00:59:01,952 --> 00:59:04,317
we can get even better terms next time.

1022
00:59:04,317 --> 00:59:06,289
- Right.
- In Rounds 2 and 3 too.

1023
00:59:06,289 --> 00:59:07,857
[Kkakk Unni drives sales with a huge deal]

1024
00:59:07,857 --> 00:59:11,728
Today's the interim rankings announcement.

1025
00:59:11,728 --> 00:59:15,451
[Round 1 interim rankings announced]
I'm so nervous today.

1026
00:59:15,451 --> 00:59:18,834
[From content to livestream commerce]
Here's the fifth Beauty Battle product.

1027
00:59:21,041 --> 00:59:25,302
[Sellers take their own approach to sales]

1028
00:59:26,543 --> 00:59:32,107
[Round 1 heats up at the halfway point]

1029
00:59:33,249 --> 00:59:34,750
[D+1]

1030
00:59:34,750 --> 00:59:38,302
[What are the Round 1 interim rankings?]

1031
00:59:39,384 --> 00:59:43,125
We'll now announce
the interim Round 1 sales rankings.

1032
00:59:43,727 --> 00:59:46,366
[Team Japan gathers for the interim results]

1033
00:59:46,366 --> 00:59:48,197
Hello.

1034
00:59:50,418 --> 00:59:51,984
It's time for the interim results.

1035
00:59:51,984 --> 00:59:54,908
Really?

1036
00:59:54,908 --> 00:59:57,574
We've been doing
livestream commerce for ten days.

1037
00:59:57,574 --> 00:59:58,984
I think we've done really well,

1038
00:59:58,984 --> 01:00:01,184
but we still have to see the results.

1039
01:00:01,184 --> 01:00:03,546
I think we'll come in first.

1040
01:00:04,151 --> 01:00:06,484
We just received the interim results.

1041
01:00:06,484 --> 01:00:09,617
Let's see where we stand.

1042
01:00:09,617 --> 01:00:12,188
I'm so nervous. This is nerve-racking.

1043
01:00:12,884 --> 01:00:15,284
I can't bear to look.

1044
01:00:15,284 --> 01:00:17,750
[Personal branding specialist]
China is probably the strongest country.

1045
01:00:17,750 --> 01:00:18,999
[The K-beauty sales queen of Malaysia]
I think it's China.

1046
01:00:18,999 --> 01:00:20,363
[One billion won monthly sales]
It's got to be China.

1047
01:00:20,363 --> 01:00:22,903
China was the country
I saw as the biggest threat.

1048
01:00:22,903 --> 01:00:25,568
[China, every country's biggest threat]

1049
01:00:25,568 --> 01:00:28,217
[Content planner with 50B won in sales]
I think the US will be strong.

1050
01:00:28,217 --> 01:00:30,740
[Japanese entertainment enterprise CEO]
I picked the US for first place.

1051
01:00:30,740 --> 01:00:33,384
[Former Vietnamese idol turned seller]
I think the US will come in first.

1052
01:00:33,384 --> 01:00:35,278
[Beauty trendsetter with 17 years' experience]
I think the US is the top contender.

1053
01:00:35,278 --> 01:00:37,781
[The US, a true commerce powerhouse]

1054
01:00:37,781 --> 01:00:41,084
[Top contenders: China and the US]

1055
01:00:41,084 --> 01:00:44,854
[Round 1 interim rankings]

1056
01:00:48,892 --> 01:00:52,117
These are the interim sales rankings
by country,

1057
01:00:52,117 --> 01:00:55,398
based on sales from March 23 to April 1.

1058
01:00:55,398 --> 01:00:58,234
A pyramid system...

1059
01:00:59,069 --> 01:01:01,404
I'm so nervous. I have chills.

1060
01:01:02,242 --> 01:01:05,838
[Round 1 interim rankings revealed]

1061
01:01:08,445 --> 01:01:12,916
Sales figures for first through fourth place
will also be revealed.

1062
01:01:12,916 --> 01:01:14,918
We'll start with third place.

1063
01:01:14,918 --> 01:01:16,886
Third place is...

1064
01:01:16,886 --> 01:01:18,654
China.

1065
01:01:19,355 --> 01:01:25,428
1,266,743,043 won.

1066
01:01:27,931 --> 01:01:30,400
We're in third right now.

1067
01:01:30,400 --> 01:01:32,902
We're only third?

1068
01:01:32,902 --> 01:01:35,371
Gosh, this can't be right.

1069
01:01:36,506 --> 01:01:40,977
If we're third, where did everyone else rank?

1070
01:01:40,977 --> 01:01:42,812
[Team China can't believe they're third]

1071
01:01:42,812 --> 01:01:45,681
China is third?

1072
01:01:46,284 --> 01:01:48,950
- China...
- China is third?

1073
01:01:48,950 --> 01:01:50,653
I thought they'd be first or second.

1074
01:01:50,653 --> 01:01:53,590
[The other teams are stunned
that favorite China placed third]

1075
01:01:53,590 --> 01:01:58,365
[Content creator with ten million fans]
China's huge market is its greatest strength.

1076
01:01:58,365 --> 01:02:00,317
Wouldn't China be strong

1077
01:02:00,317 --> 01:02:03,267
because of its huge scale
and enormous population?

1078
01:02:03,267 --> 01:02:05,658
[Team China, the favorite everyone feared]

1079
01:02:06,669 --> 01:02:09,283
[China falls short of expectations in third]

1080
01:02:09,950 --> 01:02:14,689
[Where will Team China finish Round 1?]

1081
01:02:15,315 --> 01:02:16,579
Now for fourth place.

1082
01:02:16,579 --> 01:02:20,282
Fourth place is Singapore and Malaysia.

1083
01:02:20,917 --> 01:02:24,330
[Singapore and Malaysia celebrate fourth]

1084
01:02:25,017 --> 01:02:29,359
1,202,208,525 won.

1085
01:02:29,359 --> 01:02:34,184
We're only about 60 million won behind China.

1086
01:02:34,184 --> 01:02:36,599
Fourth place means Singapore
and Malaysia still have a chance.

1087
01:02:36,599 --> 01:02:39,502
At the very least, we have to overtake China.

1088
01:02:39,502 --> 01:02:43,217
[They see a chance to overtake China]

1089
01:02:43,217 --> 01:02:47,051
With only a 60-million-won gap,
they could catch us quickly.

1090
01:02:47,051 --> 01:02:48,678
We need to find a way.

1091
01:02:48,678 --> 01:02:51,381
We need to fix everything, from our strategy

1092
01:02:51,381 --> 01:02:53,950
and livestream format
to our timing and content.

1093
01:02:53,950 --> 01:02:58,621
For the next ten days,

1094
01:02:58,621 --> 01:03:02,033
[Team China sets its sights on first]
we have to push for first place.

1095
01:03:02,896 --> 01:03:06,330
[Only 60M won apart. What lies ahead?]

1096
01:03:07,184 --> 01:03:09,999
Let's continue.

1097
01:03:09,999 --> 01:03:12,627
[5th Thailand, 6th Vietnam, 7th Japan]

1098
01:03:13,306 --> 01:03:15,575
[Team Japan ranks seventh]

1099
01:03:16,051 --> 01:03:18,841
Only third and fourth
have their sales figures listed.

1100
01:03:19,636 --> 01:03:21,977
Because they couldn't show ours?

1101
01:03:23,483 --> 01:03:25,583
They couldn't. We didn't make that much.

1102
01:03:25,583 --> 01:03:27,917
One, two, three, four...

1103
01:03:27,917 --> 01:03:29,886
Are we fifth?

1104
01:03:29,886 --> 01:03:31,821
We're fifth.

1105
01:03:31,821 --> 01:03:35,817
We still did our best. We did really well.

1106
01:03:35,817 --> 01:03:38,398
Fifth isn't bad.

1107
01:03:38,398 --> 01:03:41,289
[Fifth-place Team Thailand stays positive]

1108
01:03:42,498 --> 01:03:44,667
[Seventh, sixth, fifth, fourth]

1109
01:03:44,667 --> 01:03:49,190
[Three countries remain]

1110
01:03:49,190 --> 01:03:51,608
Then we're either last or...

1111
01:03:51,608 --> 01:03:54,110
- Wait.
- You're right. Either last or in the top two.

1112
01:03:54,110 --> 01:03:55,678
But Team USA isn't up there.

1113
01:03:55,678 --> 01:03:58,017
[Favorite Team USA still unranked]

1114
01:03:58,017 --> 01:03:59,315
First place is...

1115
01:03:59,315 --> 01:04:01,650
[Team USA won the preliminary mission]

1116
01:04:01,650 --> 01:04:06,422
The other countries seem to be
doing pretty well.

1117
01:04:06,422 --> 01:04:09,993
But we won the first preliminary mission.

1118
01:04:09,993 --> 01:04:15,784
Since we won the preliminary mission,
wouldn't we be ahead?

1119
01:04:15,784 --> 01:04:18,201
[Team USA expects to rank near the top]
I think we're probably on top.

1120
01:04:18,201 --> 01:04:21,511
We can't be eighth.

1121
01:04:21,511 --> 01:04:23,673
We might be dead last...

1122
01:04:23,673 --> 01:04:25,575
- We can't be eighth.
- No way...

1123
01:04:25,575 --> 01:04:27,343
[No team can relax until the end]

1124
01:04:27,343 --> 01:04:28,784
[Which country ranked eighth?]

1125
01:04:28,784 --> 01:04:30,480
We'll now announce eighth place.

1126
01:04:30,480 --> 01:04:31,817
Eighth place is...

1127
01:04:31,817 --> 01:04:35,358
[The US, a global commerce powerhouse]

1128
01:04:36,119 --> 01:04:39,893
[Host country's pride, South Korea]

1129
01:04:39,893 --> 01:04:43,418
[Indonesia's 170M-follower megamarket]

1130
01:04:43,418 --> 01:04:45,294
the United States.

1131
01:04:47,884 --> 01:04:48,898
No!

1132
01:04:48,898 --> 01:04:50,633
[Preliminary winner Team USA falls]

1133
01:04:50,633 --> 01:04:53,069
No, that can't be.

1134
01:04:53,069 --> 01:04:56,717
[Team USA is shocked by eighth place]

1135
01:04:56,717 --> 01:04:58,317
What?

1136
01:04:58,317 --> 01:05:01,217
There's no way it's the US.

1137
01:05:01,217 --> 01:05:03,746
Last place?
Didn't the US win the preliminary mission?

1138
01:05:03,746 --> 01:05:05,782
I don't think Team USA
has even started selling yet.

1139
01:05:05,782 --> 01:05:07,517
[Team USA's ranking shocks everyone]
- They haven't. - This makes no sense.

1140
01:05:07,517 --> 01:05:08,685
They came in eighth.

1141
01:05:08,685 --> 01:05:11,454
[An unpredictable Round 1 ranking]

1142
01:05:11,454 --> 01:05:14,017
[Can the US and China make a comeback?]

1143
01:05:14,017 --> 01:05:17,026
[Which country will claim first place?]
We'll now announce first and second place.

1144
01:05:17,564 --> 01:05:19,428
Could we be first?

1145
01:05:20,797 --> 01:05:23,499
Once eighth place was revealed,
I started getting a little hopeful.

1146
01:05:23,499 --> 01:05:28,750
[Vietnamese TikToker with 8.8M followers]
The team I'm most wary of is Team Korea.

1147
01:05:28,750 --> 01:05:32,813
At first glance, I thought Team Korea
looked the strongest.

1148
01:05:32,813 --> 01:05:36,417
Their process is very well organized.
It's very clean.

1149
01:05:36,417 --> 01:05:39,048
Team Korea definitely delivers high quality.

1150
01:05:39,048 --> 01:05:40,416
[Team Korea earns strong reviews]
The teamwork is amazing.

1151
01:05:40,416 --> 01:05:43,252
Like, everybody has their own sections.

1152
01:05:43,252 --> 01:05:48,224
[Ten days of giving their all through content]

1153
01:05:48,224 --> 01:05:50,960
Team Korea is a strong competitor.

1154
01:05:50,960 --> 01:05:53,917
If we believe in ourselves,
we can definitely win.

1155
01:05:53,917 --> 01:05:56,117
Our team is incredibly solid.

1156
01:05:56,117 --> 01:05:59,418
That's why I'm confident Indonesia can win.

1157
01:05:59,418 --> 01:06:01,804
[Team Thailand owner]
Which team feels threatening?

1158
01:06:02,905 --> 01:06:03,940
Indonesia?

1159
01:06:03,940 --> 01:06:07,276
When I first heard
Indonesia had 100 million followers,

1160
01:06:07,276 --> 01:06:08,544
the sheer number made a huge impression.

1161
01:06:08,544 --> 01:06:12,315
[The K-beauty sales queen of Malaysia]
In terms of population, I'd say Indonesia.

1162
01:06:12,315 --> 01:06:15,952
[Indonesia: 170M-follower megamarket]

1163
01:06:15,952 --> 01:06:18,683
[Two teams remain. Who takes first?]

1164
01:06:18,683 --> 01:06:24,727
And the highly anticipated
first place goes to...

1165
01:06:26,817 --> 01:06:32,075
[Who takes first place?]

1166
01:06:34,017 --> 01:06:35,518
Indonesia.

1167
01:06:35,518 --> 01:06:40,877
1,587,810,212 won.

1168
01:06:40,877 --> 01:06:46,035
[Indonesia takes first with about 1.59B won]

1169
01:06:50,518 --> 01:06:53,056
This is amazing!

1170
01:06:53,056 --> 01:06:55,691
[Team Indonesia celebrates first place]

1171
01:06:55,691 --> 01:06:56,784
[Team Korea narrowly finishes second]

1172
01:06:56,784 --> 01:06:57,984
It's not us.

1173
01:06:57,984 --> 01:06:59,429
Indonesia?

1174
01:06:59,429 --> 01:07:02,084
[Indonesia's unexpected interim ranking]

1175
01:07:02,084 --> 01:07:04,184
Second place is Korea.

1176
01:07:04,184 --> 01:07:10,418
1,444,549,164 won.

1177
01:07:10,418 --> 01:07:13,017
[Team Korea takes second by a narrow gap]

1178
01:07:13,017 --> 01:07:14,184
We just need a little more.

1179
01:07:14,184 --> 01:07:16,717
- Just a little more.
- The gap isn't big.

1180
01:07:16,717 --> 01:07:19,284
The gap is 140 million won.

1181
01:07:19,284 --> 01:07:20,883
These are the interim rankings for Round 1.

1182
01:07:20,883 --> 01:07:22,552
First, Indonesia,

1183
01:07:22,552 --> 01:07:23,850
second, Korea,

1184
01:07:23,850 --> 01:07:25,121
third, China,

1185
01:07:25,121 --> 01:07:27,056
fourth, Singapore and Malaysia,

1186
01:07:27,056 --> 01:07:28,217
fifth, Thailand,

1187
01:07:28,217 --> 01:07:29,525
sixth, Vietnam,

1188
01:07:29,525 --> 01:07:30,760
seventh, Japan,

1189
01:07:30,760 --> 01:07:33,463
and eighth, the United States.

1190
01:07:33,463 --> 01:07:37,500
[What will the final Round 1 results be?]

1191
01:07:37,500 --> 01:07:40,903
Because first through fourth are so close,

1192
01:07:40,903 --> 01:07:43,217
I feel like we can't let our guard down.

1193
01:07:43,217 --> 01:07:45,908
It could change in just one day.

1194
01:07:45,908 --> 01:07:50,084
[Team Indonesia celebrates first place]

1195
01:07:50,084 --> 01:07:52,351
I hope we can keep this up until the end.

1196
01:07:52,351 --> 01:07:55,318
Let's stick together.

1197
01:07:55,318 --> 01:07:57,820
I think staying united is what matters.

1198
01:07:57,820 --> 01:08:00,717
We need to pull ourselves together.
Team USA needs to wake up.

1199
01:08:00,717 --> 01:08:01,958
This can't happen.

1200
01:08:01,958 --> 01:08:05,828
We need to find a solution
and come back stronger.

1201
01:08:05,828 --> 01:08:07,430
I need to talk to my teammates.

1202
01:08:07,430 --> 01:08:08,865
We have to aim for first place no matter what.

1203
01:08:08,865 --> 01:08:11,901
[Round 1 ranking battle ends]
Here are the final Round 1 results.

1204
01:08:11,901 --> 01:08:13,936
I want to be at the top of the pyramid.

